// Curated in-game essentials. Advanced options remain available in the INI.
// Group order: Attendance, Soundscape, Broadcast; toggles precede numeric controls.
{"Attendance",L"Dynamic Gameday Attendance",L"Enabled","Dynamic Attendance","Let fans arrive, take breaks and leave early. Off keeps the game's normal attendance. Replays have their own switch.",1.0,0.0,1.0,Kind::Toggle},
{"Attendance",L"Dynamic Gameday Attendance",L"2020ModeEnabled","2020 Mode","Play with empty stands and quiet stadium sound. Crowd, bands, drums and PA are muted; some individual voices remain.",0.0,0.0,1.0,Kind::Toggle},
{"Attendance",L"Dynamic Gameday Attendance",L"ArrivalsEnabled","Fans Arriving After Kickoff","Let some fans reach their seats during Q1. Off seats the expected crowd at kickoff; it does not guarantee a sellout.",1.0,0.0,1.0,Kind::Toggle},
{"Attendance",L"Dynamic Gameday Attendance",L"LateTrafficEnabled","Beat the Traffic","Let fans leave sooner when the home team trails badly late in the game.",1.0,0.0,1.0,Kind::Toggle},
{"Attendance",L"Dynamic Gameday Attendance",L"DynamicAwayCrowds","Visiting Fans","Give visitors a main section and scattered seats. Support, distance and rivalries affect their numbers. Choose before starting a new game.",1.0,0.0,1.0,Kind::Toggle},
{"Attendance",L"Dynamic Gameday Attendance",L"AttendanceProfile","Attendance Profile","Default uses normal attendance. Fuller Crowds adds fans at kickoff and raises turnout in new regular-season Dynasty games. Weather and crowd limits still apply.",1,0,1,Kind::AttendanceProfile},
{"Attendance",L"Dynamic Gameday Attendance",L"Profile","Fan Patience","Automatic follows the matchup and weather. Patient Fans stay longer; Bad Weather makes fans leave sooner. Starting attendance stays the same.",0,0,3,Kind::Profile},
{"Attendance",L"Dynamic Gameday Attendance",L"StartPercent","Ordinary Kickoff Crowd (%)","The share of expected fans seated at kickoff. At 55, 55 of every 100 expected fans start seated. Special games can start fuller.",55.0,50.0,60.0,Kind::Slider},
{"Attendance",L"Dynamic Gameday Attendance",L"LateSchoolStartPercent","Late-Arriving Schools: Kickoff (%)","Starting seated share for late-arriving schools. Higher means more fans at kickoff. Night games and weather can affect it.",45.0,40.0,50.0,Kind::Slider},
{"Attendance",L"Dynamic Gameday Attendance",L"BigGameBonus","Big Game Kickoff Bonus (points)","Add a small kickoff crowd boost for ranked matchups and qualifying rivalries. Applies to newly started games.",3.0,0.0,3.0,Kind::Slider},
{"Attendance",L"Dynamic Gameday Attendance",L"FinishPercentOfQuarter","When Arrivals Finish (% of Q1)","When ordinary arrivals finish during Q1. At 50, fans finish arriving halfway through the quarter. Special games keep their own timing.",50.0,10.0,100.0,Kind::Slider},
{"Attendance",L"Dynamic Gameday Attendance",L"FormulaStrength","Fans Leaving Early (%)","How strongly the score and time make fans leave. 100 is normal, 50 is gentler and 200 is stronger. At 0, these departures stop.",100.0,0.0,200.0,Kind::Slider},
{"Attendance",L"Dynamic Gameday Attendance",L"HalftimeSeatBreakStrength","Halftime Seat Breaks (%)","How many fans briefly leave their seats at halftime. 100 is normal; higher means more breaks. Remaining fans return early in Q3.",100.0,0.0,200.0,Kind::Slider},
{"Soundscape",L"Dynamic Gameday Soundscape",L"Enabled","Crowd Sound Effects","Make crowd sound follow attendance and add play reactions. Off keeps normal game sound. Restart MMC and the game after changing this switch.",1.0,0.0,1.0,Kind::Toggle},
{"Soundscape",L"Dynamic Gameday Soundscape",L"LayeredAtmosphereEnabled","Extra Crowd Energy","Add roars, buildup and stronger play reactions. Larger effects need enough fans present. Off removes these extra layers.",1.0,0.0,1.0,Kind::Toggle},
{"Soundscape",L"Dynamic Gameday Soundscape",L"OpeningAtmosphere","Opening Atmosphere","Add energy at kickoff and during the opening series. Big games and qualifying rivalries can get extra crowd shake.",1.0,0.0,1.0,Kind::Toggle},
{"Soundscape",L"Dynamic Gameday Soundscape",L"PlayCallAtmosphere","Play Selection Atmosphere","Build crowd noise during play selection. Close late games and important situations get extra energy.",1.0,0.0,1.0,Kind::Toggle},
{"Soundscape",L"Dynamic Gameday Soundscape",L"OvertimeAtmosphere","Overtime Atmosphere","Add crowd energy between overtime plays, kicks and two-point tries. Stronger effects still need enough fans present.",1.0,0.0,1.0,Kind::Toggle},
{"Soundscape",L"Dynamic Gameday Soundscape",L"UpsetWatchAtmosphere","Upset Watch Sounds","Build excitement when a home underdog threatens a ranked visitor from Q2 onward. Either underdog can qualify at a neutral site.",1.0,0.0,1.0,Kind::Toggle},
{"Soundscape",L"Dynamic Gameday Soundscape",L"DuringPlayReactionsEnabled","Live Play Reactions","Add reactions to catches, runs, sacks, takeaways and returns. Bigger plays and crowds can produce stronger sounds.",1.0,0.0,1.0,Kind::Toggle},
{"Soundscape",L"Dynamic Gameday Soundscape",L"SkillMoveReactions","Skill Move and Big Hit Reactions","Add short reactions to successful skill moves and big hits. Turn off to remove these extra accents.",1.0,0.0,1.0,Kind::Toggle},
{"Soundscape",L"Dynamic Gameday Soundscape",L"PassFlightAnticipation","Buildup During Passes","Let the crowd build anticipation while a qualifying pass is in the air, then settle after the catch or incompletion. Does not add shake before the catch. Live Play Reactions must be on.",1.0,0.0,1.0,Kind::Toggle},
{"Soundscape",L"Dynamic Gameday Soundscape",L"SituationalCrowdReactions","Cheers and Disappointment","Home and visiting fans react to good plays and mistakes. More supporters means a bigger response. Turn Away Team Reaction Shake off to keep visitor reactions sound-only. Neutral stadiums keep their usual shared-crowd balance.",1.0,0.0,1.0,Kind::Toggle},
{"Soundscape",L"Dynamic Gameday Soundscape",L"WinningEruptions","Major Celebrations","Use the biggest celebration for special moments, such as a very early touchdown, a late winning score, an overtime winner or a game-sealing takeaway. A long touchdown alone gets the normal touchdown celebration.",1.0,0.0,1.0,Kind::Toggle},
{"Soundscape",L"Dynamic Gameday Soundscape",L"CrowdMixStrengthPercent","Crowd Volume Adjustment (%)","How much the mod changes crowd volume for the fans present. 100 uses the normal mod mix. Lower stays closer to the game's normal volume; 0 keeps normal volume unless the stands are empty. Does not reduce the game's own excitement.",100,0,100,Kind::Slider},
{"Broadcast",L"Dynamic Gameday Broadcast",L"PauseMenuFullness","Show Fullness in Pause Menu","Show the percentage of seats filled beside Resume in the pause menu. It updates when you open the menu. A dash means the crowd measurement is not ready yet.",1.0,0.0,1.0,Kind::Toggle},
{"Broadcast",L"Dynamic Gameday Broadcast",L"CameraShake","Added Camera Shake","Allow camera shake added by this mod. Turn off to stop all of the mod's added shake. The game's Dynamic Camera Effects setting must also be on.",1.0,0.0,1.0,Kind::Toggle},
{"Broadcast",L"Dynamic Gameday Broadcast",L"WidePlayerCameraCompensation","Wide Player Camera Compensation","Camera zoom is balanced automatically. Turn On only if extremely wide RTG or player-lock views still feel weak: it allows extra correction on those views. Normal cameras usually do not need this. Added Camera Shake must be on.",0.0,0.0,1.0,Kind::Toggle},
{"Broadcast",L"Dynamic Gameday Broadcast",L"ExtraReplaysEnabled","Additional Replays","Request extra replays after plays. Off stops added requests; the game can still show its own replays.",1.0,0.0,1.0,Kind::Toggle},
{"Broadcast",L"Dynamic Gameday Broadcast",L"FullScreenBigPlays","Full-Screen Big Play Replays","Request full-screen replays after big gains. The game must have a replay available. Additional Replays must be on.",1.0,0.0,1.0,Kind::Toggle},
{"Broadcast",L"Dynamic Gameday Broadcast",L"InsetAfterRoutinePlays","Small Replays During Play Selection","Allow small replays during play selection after ordinary runs and catches. Additional Replays must be on. Slow Sim has no play-selection window.",1.0,0.0,1.0,Kind::Toggle},
{"Broadcast",L"Dynamic Gameday Broadcast",L"DefensiveHighlights","Defensive Play Replays","Request extra sack, tackle-for-loss and takeaway replays. Additional Replays must be on.",1.0,0.0,1.0,Kind::Toggle},
{"Broadcast",L"Dynamic Gameday Broadcast",L"AwayTeamReactionShakeEnabled","Away Team Reaction Shake","Let visiting fans cause shake after big plays and stops. More visitors mean a stronger response. Off keeps the sounds but removes this shake.",1.0,0.0,1.0,Kind::Toggle},
{"Broadcast",L"Dynamic Gameday Broadcast",L"NeutralSiteShakePercent","Neutral-Site Crowd Shake (%)","Added crowd shake for either team at neutral sites. 75 is normal, 100 matches home-stadium strength and 0 turns it off. Cannon shake is separate.",75.0,0.0,100.0,Kind::Slider},
{"Broadcast",L"Dynamic Gameday Broadcast",L"OrdinaryShakeStrengthPercent","Normal Play Selection Shake (%)","Maximum shake during normal play selection. Higher is stronger; 0 turns this shake off. Punt buildup uses half this strength.",5.0,0.0,100.0,Kind::Slider},
{"Broadcast",L"Dynamic Gameday Broadcast",L"CriticalShakeStrengthPercent","Important Down Shake (%)","Maximum buildup shake on important third and fourth downs in close games. Higher is stronger; 0 turns this type off.",10.0,0.0,100.0,Kind::Slider},
{"Broadcast",L"Dynamic Gameday Broadcast",L"DuringPlayShakeStrengthPercent","Live Play Shake (%)","Added shake for gains, takeaways and important stops. Higher is stronger; 0 turns it off. Bigger events get more shake.",11.0,0.0,30.0,Kind::Choice},
{"Broadcast",L"Dynamic Gameday Broadcast",L"TouchdownShakeStrengthPercent","Touchdown Shake (%)","Sustained touchdown shake after the first impact. Higher is stronger; 0 turns touchdown shake off.",16.0,0.0,100.0,Kind::Slider},
{"Broadcast",L"Dynamic Gameday Broadcast",L"EruptionShakeStrengthPercent","Major Celebration Shake (%)","Sustained shake for a major celebration, such as a winning play. Higher is stronger; 0 turns this type off.",22.5,0.0,100.0,Kind::Choice},
{"Broadcast",L"Dynamic Gameday Broadcast",L"CannonShakeStrengthPercent","Stadium Cannon Shake (%)","Shake when a stadium cannon fires. At 0, cannon sound remains without added shake. Camera shake and Dynamic Camera Effects must be on.",18.0,0.0,30.0,Kind::Choice},
{"Broadcast",L"Dynamic Gameday Broadcast",L"StandardCameraShakePercent","Standard Camera Shake (%)","How much added shake you get with the Standard camera. 100 is the recommended balance, 50 is half as strong and 200 is twice as strong. 0 turns added shake off for this camera. The crowd still needs to qualify for shake.",100.0,0.0,200.0,Kind::Slider},
{"Broadcast",L"Dynamic Gameday Broadcast",L"ZoomCameraShakePercent","Zoom Camera Shake (%)","How much added shake you get with the Zoom camera. 100 is the recommended balance, 50 is half as strong and 200 is twice as strong. 0 turns added shake off for this camera. The crowd still needs to qualify for shake.",100.0,0.0,200.0,Kind::Slider},
{"Broadcast",L"Dynamic Gameday Broadcast",L"All22CameraShakePercent","All-22 Camera Shake (%)","How much added shake you get with the All-22 camera. 100 is the recommended balance, 50 is half as strong and 200 is twice as strong. 0 turns added shake off for this camera. The crowd still needs to qualify for shake.",100.0,0.0,200.0,Kind::Slider},
{"Broadcast",L"Dynamic Gameday Broadcast",L"WideCameraShakePercent","Wide Camera Shake (%)","How much added shake you get with the Wide camera. 100 is the recommended balance, 50 is half as strong and 200 is twice as strong. 0 turns added shake off for this camera. The crowd still needs to qualify for shake.",100.0,0.0,200.0,Kind::Slider},
{"Broadcast",L"Dynamic Gameday Broadcast",L"BroadcastCameraShakePercent","Broadcast Camera Shake (%)","How much added shake you get with the Broadcast camera. 100 is the recommended balance, 50 is half as strong and 200 is twice as strong. 0 turns added shake off for this camera. The crowd still needs to qualify for shake.",100.0,0.0,200.0,Kind::Slider},

