{"Broadcast",L"Dynamic Gameday Broadcast",L"FullScreenMinimumYards","Big Play Replay Minimum Yards","Minimum gain for added full-screen replays. Default is 12 yards. Additional Replays and Full-Screen Big Play Replays must be on.",12,10,60,Kind::Slider},

