{"Attendance",L"Dynamic Gameday Attendance",L"RegenerateNextCrowd","Regenerate Next Crowd","Rebuild the next newly started Dynasty crowd, then turn Off. Current games and other saved crowds stay unchanged. The same inputs may give the same crowd.",0,0,1,Kind::Toggle},
